if(B.d.p(s,"fraud")||B.d.p(s,"fraudlens"))return"*Plucks a grand, sweeping chord on the lute!*\n\nAh, Contract FraudLens! Anshul's legendary financial defense system. By fusing XGBoost with Isolation Forest algorithms, he achieved an astounding test PR-AUC of 0.8589 and ROC-AUC of 0.9971, backed by a resilient Django REST API and Flutter mobile HUD!"
else if(B.d.p(s,"leaf")||B.d.p(s,"plant")||B.d.p(s,"crop")||B.d.p(s,"compass"))return"*Tips feathered cap with a flourish.*\n\nContract Leaf Compass\u2014the salvation of the harvest! Anshul forged a custom CNN across the PlantVillage dataset classifying 38 distinct plant diseases, providing predictive crop yield and fertilizer advisories via high-speed FastAPI microservices and Docker!"
else if(B.d.p(s,"infra")||B.d.p(s,"infraintel")||B.d.p(s,"sre")||B.d.p(s,"ongoing"))return"*Strums an energetic rhythm on the strings!*\n\nHis ongoing opus: Contract InfraIntel! An autonomous cloud infrastructure intelligence platform engineered with FastAPI and Docker that predicts system outages and telemetry drifts before disaster strikes!"
else if(B.d.p(s,"weather")||B.d.p(s,"weatherwise")||B.d.p(s,"climate")||B.d.p(s,"forecast")||B.d.p(s,"rain"))return"*Sweeps a tempestuous arpeggio on the lute!*\n\nContract WeatherWise\u2014mastery over sky and storm! Anshul trained Random Forest ML models across 1,000,000+ historical climate records to forecast temperatures within 1.45\xb0C MAE and predict rainfall with 84.70% accuracy, paired with a resilient Django REST backend and a sleek Flutter mobile client!"
else if(B.d.p(s,"aws")||B.d.p(s,"cert")||B.d.p(s,"mutagen"))return"*Strikes a dramatic pose!*\n\nA badge of pure gold, traveler! Anshul is an AWS Certified Machine Learning Engineer \u2013 Associate! (Validation ID: 1cb4efb1d7f64bf7a9688e7e494d7676, verifiable directly at aws.amazon.com/verification)."
